<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Dashboard | CampusRide</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: #f4f8f7;
            color: #24352f;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .dashboard-layout {
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* Top navigation */
        .topbar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 18px 5%;
            background: white;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5eee9;
        }

        .brand {
            color: #047857;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .topbar-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .profile-circle {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #d1fae5;
            color: #065f46;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .logout-link {
            color: #b91c1c;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Page content */
        .dashboard-content {
            max-width: 1250px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px 25px;
        }

        .welcome-banner {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 25px;
            padding: 35px;
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #064e3b, #059669);
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .welcome-banner h1 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        .welcome-banner p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #d1fae5;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .welcome-emoji {
            font-size: 65px;
        }

        .section-title {
            margin: 35px 0 18px;
            font-size: 23px;
            color: #123b32;
        }

        /* Quick actions */
        .quick-actions {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .action-card {
            display: block;
            padding: 22px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e5eee9;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .action-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: #6ee7b7;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(6, 78, 59, 0.08);
        }

        .action-icon {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            background: #d1fae5;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .action-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            color: #123b32;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .action-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #718078;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Statistics */
        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .stat-card {
            padding: 23px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e5eee9;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .stat-label {
            color: #718078;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .stat-number {
            display: block;
            margin: 12px 0 5px;
            color: #065f46;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .stat-description {
            color: #8b9991;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* Main dashboard columns */
        .dashboard-columns {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
            gap: 22px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .panel {
            padding: 25px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e5eee9;
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .panel-heading {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .panel-heading h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #123b32;
        }

        .view-link {
            color: #047857;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .empty-state {
            padding: 25px 12px;
            text-align: center;
            background: #f8faf9;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .empty-state .empty-icon {
            font-size: 36px;
        }

        .empty-state h3 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .empty-state p {
            color: #718078;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .small-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 8px;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            background: #059669;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Tips */
        .tip-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 13px;
            padding: 15px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2ef;
        }

        .tip-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .tip-icon {
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .tip-item h3 {
            margin: 0 0 5px;
            color: #374151;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .tip-item p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #718078;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Bottom links */
        .bottom-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 22px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e5eee9;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .bottom-links a {
            padding: 10px 15px;
            background: #ecfdf5;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #047857;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .dashboard-footer {
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #718078;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .quick-actions,
            .stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            }

            .dashboard-columns {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 550px) {
            .topbar {
                padding: 15px;
            }

            .topbar-right {
                gap: 10px;
            }

            .dashboard-content {
                padding: 20px 14px;
            }

            .welcome-banner {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }

            .welcome-banner h1 {
                font-size: 25px;
            }

            .welcome-emoji {
                display: none;
            }

            .quick-actions,
            .stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .panel {
                padding: 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<%
    const currentUser = typeof user !== 'undefined' ? user : {};
    const displayName =
        currentUser.full_name ||
        currentUser.name ||
        currentUser.username ||
        'Student';

    const initial = displayName.charAt(0).toUpperCase();
%>

<div class="dashboard-layout">

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <header class="topbar">
        <a href="/dashboard" class="brand">🚗 CampusRide</a>

        <div class="topbar-right">
            <span>Welcome, <strong><%= displayName %></strong></span>

            <div class="profile-circle">
                <%= initial %>
            </div>

            <a href="/logout" class="logout-link">Logout</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="dashboard-content">

        <!-- Welcome Banner -->
        <section class="welcome-banner">
            <div>
                <h1>Hello, <%= displayName %>! 👋</h1>

                <p>
                    Welcome to your student carpool dashboard.<br>
                    Find a ride, offer a seat, and manage your journeys.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="welcome-emoji">🚘</div>
        </section>

        <!-- Quick Actions -->
        <h2 class="section-title">What would you like to do?</h2>
        
        <section class="quick-actions">
            <!-- Find a Ride -->
             <a href="/trips/search" class="action-card">
                <div class="action-icon">🔎</div>
                <h3>Find a Ride</h3>
                <p>Search for trips that match your journey.</p>
            </a>
            <!-- Offer a Ride -->
             
            <a href="/trips/new" class="action-card">
                <div class="action-icon">🗺️</div>
                <h3>Offer a Ride</h3>
                <p>Create a trip and share available seats.</p>
            </a>
            
            <!-- Register Vehicle -->
             <a href="/vehicle" class="action-card">
                <div class="action-icon">🚘</div>
                <h3>Register Vehicle</h3>
                <p>Add your vehicle details to the platform.</p>
            </a>
            
            <!-- My Bookings -->
             <a href="/bookings" class="action-card">
                <div class="action-icon">🎫</div>
                <h3>My Bookings</h3>
                <p>Check your ride booking requests.</p>
            </a>
        </section>

        

        <!-- Statistics -->
        <h2 class="section-title">Your Activity</h2>

        <section class="stats-grid">

            <div class="stat-card">
                <span class="stat-label">Available Rides</span>
                <span class="stat-number">🚘</span>
                <span class="stat-description">Explore available trips</span>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <span class="stat-label">My Trips</span>
                <span class="stat-number">🗺️</span>
                <span class="stat-description">Manage trips you offer</span>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <span class="stat-label">My Bookings</span>
                <span class="stat-number">🎫</span>
                <span class="stat-description">Review your bookings</span>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <span class="stat-label">Pending Requests</span>
                <span class="stat-number">📬</span>
                <span class="stat-description">Review outstanding requests</span>
            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- Recent Trips and Tips -->
        <section class="dashboard-columns">

            <div class="panel">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <h2>🗺️ Recent Trips</h2>
                    <a href="/trips" class="view-link">View trips →</a>
                </div>

                <div class="empty-state">
                    <div class="empty-icon">🚗</div>
                    <h3>Ready for your next journey?</h3>
                    <p>
                        Explore available trips and look for a ride
                        that matches your destination.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/trips" class="small-button">Explore Rides</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <h2>🛡️ Travel Tips</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="tip-item">
                    <div class="tip-icon">👤</div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Check Driver Details</h3>
                        <p>Review available driver and vehicle information before booking.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tip-item">
                    <div class="tip-icon">⏰</div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Be on Time</h3>
                        <p>Confirm the pickup time and arrive at the agreed location.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tip-item">
                    <div class="tip-icon">💬</div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Communicate Clearly</h3>
                        <p>Agree on the pickup point and journey details before travelling.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- Useful Links -->
        <h2 class="section-title">Quick Navigation</h2>
        
        <nav class="bottom-links">
            <a href="/">🏠 Home</a>
            <a href="/trips/search">🔎 Browse Trips</a>
            <a href="/trips/new">➕ Create Trip</a>
            <a href="/bookings">🎫 My Bookings</a>
            <a href="/vehicle">🚗 My Vehicle</a>
            <a href="/logout">🚪 Logout</a>
        </nav>
        

    </main>

    <footer class="dashboard-footer">
        <p>© 2026 CampusRide | Student Carpool System</p>
        <p>Connecting students, one journey at a time. 🌿</p>
    </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>